---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import consultFamily from '../assets/images/office-exterior.webp';
import signingDocuments from '../assets/images/office-montgomery.jpg';
---

<section id="about" class="border-b border-stone-200 bg-white py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-14">
      <div class="self-start lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:col-span-4" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">San Francisco Legal Advocacy</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-[1.9rem] leading-[1.12] font-semibold sm:text-[2.35rem]">
          Your Immigration Lawyer in San Francisco
        </h2>
        <span class="rule-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>

        <div class="mt-8 border border-stone-200 border-t-2 border-t-brand-800 bg-stone-50 p-5">
          <span class="eyebrow">Principal Counsel</span>
          <p class="mt-2 font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Maisoun Sulfab, Esq.</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
            Founder &amp; Principal Attorney · CA Bar #313318
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 border-t border-stone-200 pt-4 text-[11.5px] leading-snug text-slate-600">
            <p class="flex gap-2">
              <Icon name="check" class="mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-brand-800" />
              Admitted in all four California federal district courts
            </p>
            <p class="flex gap-2">
              <Icon name="check" class="mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-brand-800" />
              USPTO registered patent practice
            </p>
            <p class="flex gap-2">
              <Icon name="check" class="mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0 text-brand-800" />
              In-person, phone and video consultations
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/about-us" class="link-arrow mt-5">
          More about the firm
          <Icon name="arrow-right" class="size-3.5" />
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-8">
        <div class="space-y-5 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.85] text-slate-700 sm:text-[15px]">
          <p class="first-letter:float-left first-letter:mt-1 first-letter:mr-2.5 first-letter:font-serif first-letter:text-[3.2rem] first-letter:leading-[0.8] first-letter:font-semibold first-letter:text-brand-800">
            If you are searching for an immigration lawyer in San Francisco, chances are something
            has already gone wrong or is about to. A family member is in detention. A hearing notice
            arrived. An application has been sitting for months. Sulfab Law Office is an immigration
            law firm in San Francisco built for exactly these moments, and for the quieter ones too,
            like planning a family petition the right way the first time.
          </p>
          <p>
            Maisoun Sulfab is a California immigration attorney who works in immigration court and
            in federal court. Her practice centers on removal defense, asylum, family-based
            petitions, and detention cases that need to be challenged through federal habeas corpus.
            That last part matters. When someone is detained, the immigration system moves slowly
            while the person’s life does not. Sometimes the fastest path to a fair outcome is a
            federal judge.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <figure class="overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-card">
            <div class="overflow-hidden">
              <Image
                src={consultFamily}
                alt="Sulfab Law Office building in San Francisco's Financial District"
                widths={[480, 720, 960]}
                sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 32vw, (min-width: 640px) 45vw, 90vw"
                format="webp"
                quality={82}
                loading="lazy"
                class="h-56 w-full object-cover object-center transition duration-700 hover:scale-[1.04] sm:h-64"
              />
            </div>
            <figcaption class="border-t border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-3 text-[11px] leading-snug font-medium text-slate-600">
              Our office in the San Francisco Financial District.
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 bg-white shadow-card">
            <div class="overflow-hidden">
              <Image
                src={signingDocuments}
                alt="Sulfab Law Office building on Montgomery Street, San Francisco"
                widths={[480, 720, 960]}
                sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 32vw, (min-width: 640px) 45vw, 90vw"
                format="webp"
                quality={82}
                loading="lazy"
                class="h-56 w-full object-cover object-center transition duration-700 hover:scale-[1.04] sm:h-64"
              />
            </div>
            <figcaption class="border-t border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-3 text-[11px] leading-snug font-medium text-slate-600">
              Serving clients from our office in the Financial District.
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:mt-16">
      <article class="border border-stone-200 border-t-2 border-t-brand-800 bg-stone-50 p-6 shadow-card" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xl leading-snug font-semibold">
          <Icon name="scale" class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-800" />
          What an Immigration Attorney in San Francisco Actually Does
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          A good immigration attorney in San Francisco does three things. First, we read your file
          closely and tell you where you really stand, including the weak spots. Second, we choose
          the right forum and the right form of relief, whether that is an asylum claim, a bond
          hearing, a family petition or a federal petition. Third, we stay on the case until there
          is a result, because immigration matters rarely end with a single filing.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="border border-stone-200 border-t-2 border-t-brand-800 bg-stone-50 p-6 shadow-card" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-xl leading-snug font-semibold">
          <Icon name="landmark" class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-800" />
          Why Immigration Lawyers in California Face a Different Landscape
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          As an immigration lawyer in California, I see how much depends on the court that hears
          your case. Detention practices, bond hearing availability and federal court responses
          differ across the Northern, Eastern, Central and Southern Districts. Maisoun is admitted
          in all four, which lets the firm follow a case to whichever federal court has jurisdiction
          over where a client is held.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 border-t border-stone-200 pt-4">
          {['N.D. Cal.', 'E.D. Cal.', 'C.D. Cal.', 'S.D. Cal.'].map((court) => (
            <span class="chip bg-white">{court}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
